// Second file of the module. The mod loader concatenates every src/**.cm
// file into one virtual program and checks it ONCE, so a top-level
// function declared here is callable from main.cm with no import: the
// module is the unit of compilation, files are just organization.
//
// Note the camelCase name: top-level script declarations are camelCase
// (§2.5). PascalCase is reserved for schema boundary types (Item,
// OrderEvent) and capability/interface members (FetchItem, OnOrder).
int priceFor(int qty) {
    return qty * 10
}
